    "body": "Problem: #31 added a new TERMINFO variable that is checked at build\ntime; this was added to the Makefile but not the CMake script (which\nNeovim uses).\n\nSolution: Define TERMINFO in CMakeLists.txt as well, copying the logic\nfrom the Makefile.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-27T07:36:18Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I didn't forget it. The CMake support was already lacking in many ways. I started [work](https://github.com/jamessan/unibilium/commits/cmake-fixes) on bringing that up to par overall. I can work on wrapping that up in the next few days.",
